","https://www.traveldiariesapp.com/en/travel-inspiration/denmark/mols-bjerge-national-park","https://evendo.com/locations/denmark/mols-bjerge-national-park/best-attractions"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Trehoje","type":"activity","detail":"Bronze age burial mounds at 127 m, with the whole peninsula below: Aarhus one way, Ebeltoft the other, and the four bays of Kalo, Begtrup, Knebel and Ebeltoft.","evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":12,"urls":["https://eng.nationalparkmolsbjerge.dk/","https://www.ebeltoft.dk/en/attractions/mols-bjerge-national-park/","https://evendo.com/locations/denmark/mols-bjerge-national-park/best-attractions"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Poskaer Stenhus","type":"activity","detail":"A stone age round dolmen standing in open country, ringed by its own kerb of boulders.","evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":12,"urls":["https://eng.nationalparkmolsbjerge.dk/","https://www.ebeltoft.dk/en/attractions/mols-bjerge-national-park/","https://evendo.com/locations/denmark/mols-bjerge-national-park/best-attractions"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Ebeltoft old town","type":"activity","detail":"Leaning half timbered houses, cobbles and hollyhocks growing head high against the walls, twenty minutes down the coast.","evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":12,"urls":["https://eng.nationalparkmolsbjerge.dk/experience-the-national-park/ebeltoft","https://www.boote-magazin.de/en/travel-and-charter/territories/national-parks-of-the-baltic-sea-mols-bjerge-in-denmark/","https://triplyzer.com/denmark/things-to-do-in-ebeltoft/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Out on the water","type":"activity","detail":"The park keeps a vintage ship running coastal trips, and the sheltered bays are kayaking water for days at a time.","season":[5,6,7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":12,"urls":["https://eng.nationalparkmolsbjerge.dk/experience-the-national-park/activities/out-on-the-water","https://www.boote-magazin.de/en/travel-and-charter/terri